{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Marbleous!",
    "steam_appid": 3356500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/a8194bc67ea96bd7bb1a84f07d627cc5.avif?t=1734189913\" width=780 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Marbleous!</i>, the excitement of marble racing meets the thrill of creativity! Build custom tracks, choose your competitors, and watch up to 12 marbles compete for the podium in a vibrant display of color and motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/f6e6db6677740852dd0bf74a2ccdabe3.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/f6e6db6677740852dd0bf74a2ccdabe3.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/f6e6db6677740852dd0bf74a2ccdabe3.mp4?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/d633b02c981310628e167dad1c3ff277.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/d633b02c981310628e167dad1c3ff277.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner architect with <i>Marbleous!</i>\u2019s track-building system! Design circuits with wild pieces, challenging curves, and thrilling jumps. Every race you create could become the next favorite among players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/fb9ba3a2c3dc4f05078a3b2cb39bf44e.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/fb9ba3a2c3dc4f05078a3b2cb39bf44e.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide range of marbles to choose from, you can select up to 12 unique competitors for each race. Featuring colorful and stylish designs, each competition is a showcase of speed and flair. Will your favorites make it to the top, or will there be a surprise finish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/aebd0380380e40c2a1186a88195983d2.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/aebd0380380e40c2a1186a88195983d2.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit play and watch the magic happen! Marbles rolling, colliding, defying gravity, racing through each curve and obstacle in search of victory. If you're a fan of physics simulations, <i>Marbleous!</i> takes marble racing to a whole new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/992d0ac7d023039871ee4fa4a431838a.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/992d0ac7d023039871ee4fa4a431838a.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place power-up capsules on your track, and watch the marbles do incredible acts like turning into a ghost to stop colliding with others or becoming a steel marble and increase their mass!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/8a52d70f8e72f2a25ab095431cd1602a.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/8a52d70f8e72f2a25ab095431cd1602a.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your creations beyond the screen! With the track import/export tool, you can share your designs with friends and challenge them to beat your times. The fun multiplies when you swap your best tracks with other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/735f42d5024cbb63f0fb27f910c390b7.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/735f42d5024cbb63f0fb27f910c390b7.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovate with new designs, master advanced techniques, and create a collection of tracks that will be the dream challenge for marble racers everywhere! Will your track become the ultimate test for everyone?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/a8194bc67ea96bd7bb1a84f07d627cc5.avif?t=1734189913\" width=780 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Marbleous!</i>, the excitement of marble racing meets the thrill of creativity! Build custom tracks, choose your competitors, and watch up to 12 marbles compete for the podium in a vibrant display of color and motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/f6e6db6677740852dd0bf74a2ccdabe3.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/f6e6db6677740852dd0bf74a2ccdabe3.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/f6e6db6677740852dd0bf74a2ccdabe3.mp4?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/d633b02c981310628e167dad1c3ff277.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/d633b02c981310628e167dad1c3ff277.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner architect with <i>Marbleous!</i>\u2019s track-building system! Design circuits with wild pieces, challenging curves, and thrilling jumps. Every race you create could become the next favorite among players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/fb9ba3a2c3dc4f05078a3b2cb39bf44e.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/fb9ba3a2c3dc4f05078a3b2cb39bf44e.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide range of marbles to choose from, you can select up to 12 unique competitors for each race. Featuring colorful and stylish designs, each competition is a showcase of speed and flair. Will your favorites make it to the top, or will there be a surprise finish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/aebd0380380e40c2a1186a88195983d2.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/aebd0380380e40c2a1186a88195983d2.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit play and watch the magic happen! Marbles rolling, colliding, defying gravity, racing through each curve and obstacle in search of victory. If you're a fan of physics simulations, <i>Marbleous!</i> takes marble racing to a whole new level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/992d0ac7d023039871ee4fa4a431838a.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/992d0ac7d023039871ee4fa4a431838a.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place power-up capsules on your track, and watch the marbles do incredible acts like turning into a ghost to stop colliding with others or becoming a steel marble and increase their mass!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/8a52d70f8e72f2a25ab095431cd1602a.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/8a52d70f8e72f2a25ab095431cd1602a.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your creations beyond the screen! With the track import/export tool, you can share your designs with friends and challenge them to beat your times. The fun multiplies when you swap your best tracks with other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/735f42d5024cbb63f0fb27f910c390b7.poster.avif?t=1734189913\" width=800 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356500/extras/735f42d5024cbb63f0fb27f910c390b7.webm?t=1734189913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovate with new designs, master advanced techniques, and create a collection of tracks that will be the dream challenge for marble racers everywhere! Will your track become the ultimate test for everyone?</p>",
